Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.83,0:01:01.45,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.99,0:01:02.62,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.92,0:01:06.62,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:08.88,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,He saved you, didn't he.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.92,0:01:12.80,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you try talking with Sanada more often?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.80,0:01:13.71,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.42,0:01:15.22,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.59,0:01:17.47,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Just the two of you, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.47,0:01:22.47,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fscx92.5\pos(970,700)}{\fnCrayonAL\fs120\c&H49488D&\1a&11&}romantic feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.81,0:01:26.85,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe you'll realize some things if you try talking to Sanada.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.81,0:01:30.98,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,He just saved you, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.57,0:01:34.44,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Wouldn't that put him on the same level as Kazehaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.82,0:01:35.82,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Same level?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.15,0:01:38.78,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,How do you feel about Sanada?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.16,0:01:41.58,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I think he's really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.58,0:01:43.49,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,See? That's the same way you feel about Kazehaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.49,0:01:46.21,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Sanada doesn't avoid you or anything, does he?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.58,0:01:48.33,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,N-No...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.04,0:01:51.79,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,The game!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.79,0:01:54.42,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,The game just started, Kurumi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.42,0:01:56.59,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you even listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.59,0:01:58.05,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.05,0:01:59.43,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I am, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.34,0:02:05.14,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,You wanted to watch Kazehaya-kun play, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.06,0:02:13.73,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,When I heard about Kazehaya-kun playing baseball\N during middle school, I really wanted to see him play.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.86,0:02:19.20,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to see the side of him I didn't know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.11,0:02:21.32,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.99,0:02:26.70,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,You don't know anything about him... about Kazehaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.83,0:02:31.38,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you dare put our feelings on the same level.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:38.34,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I've been watching him ever since middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.34,0:02:40.51,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Even on rainy days...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.51,0:02:41.72,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,On rainy days?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.72,0:02:42.89,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Even on windy days...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.89,0:02:44.10,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Even on windy days?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:46.10,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Even in a blizzard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.10,0:02:47.60,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,In a blizzard?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.18,0:02:54.94,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,And whenever there was a chance, I'd go and talk to him,\N and I always worked hard to make sure he didn't find a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.94,0:02:55.69,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Y-
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.78,0:02:58.40,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,You went through a lot, didn't you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.40,0:03:01.11,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, yeah! It was tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.07,0:03:04.03,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.03,0:03:09.29,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, that's how much I know Kazehaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.29,0:03:12.08,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like I just met him yesterday or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.08,0:03:13.46,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I've...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.46,0:03:15.04,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I've had my eyes on him for a while, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.46,0:03:16.25,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.13,0:03:21.13,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.26,0:03:23.76,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Let's keep this up, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.76,0:03:25.30,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.89,0:03:30.52,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I know what you mean. My eyes just won't leave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.56,0:03:38.53,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Quit pretending like you know how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.40,0:03:45.99,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Whenever I catch myself, my eyes are on Kazehaya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.99,0:03:48.33,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I just can't look at anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.37,0:03:56.63,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I catch myself thinking about him all the time,\N and his face always appears in my mind before I go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.38,0:04:03.43,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I've never felt this way about anyone before,\N so I thought these feelings were something special.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.43,0:04:10.64,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I... really believe I don't know anything about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.14,0:04:15.44,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe these feelings will come,\N even if I'm thinking about someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.11,0:04:18.90,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe there's a feeling that's even greater.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.74,0:04:24.16,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.57,0:04:30.62,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I want to know more about Kazehaya-kun and my own feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.20,0:04:33.54,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Strike three! You're out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.04,0:04:37.13,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to try talking to Sanada-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.71,0:04:41.46,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, Kurumi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:44.55,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,She... accepted my challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.60,0:04:51.77,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to be doing things my own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.27,0:04:56.98,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,K-Kurumi-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.98,0:04:58.36,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,What about the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.36,0:04:59.40,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.94,0:05:02.94,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,M-Maybe she didn't want to watch it with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.82,0:05:12.37,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya-kun must be really special to her...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.37,0:05:14.46,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,She's always been watching him, after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.08,0:05:17.29,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I really want to go out with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.96,0:05:19.21,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,She wants to go out with him...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.67,0:05:23.30,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, so Kurumi-chan must have romantic feelings for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.13,0:05:27.01,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Romantic... feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.77,0:05:34.56,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Romantic feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.77,0:05:42.32,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,That's the first term I really\N understood from the bottom of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.53,0:05:47.70,Default,Guys,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for the match!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.53,0:05:51.49,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,We cleared the first round!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:53.62,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.16,0:05:56.00,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Great job, Kazehaya-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.50,0:05:58.92,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Great job, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.46,0:06:02.75,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumi-chan never came back, after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.75,0:06:05.13,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, so there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.76,0:06:08.88,Default,Tomo,0000,0000,0000,,It's hard to spot you with that hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.88,0:06:10.34,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Endou-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.34,0:06:11.55,Default,Tomo,0000,0000,0000,,It's Tomo, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.18,0:06:15.10,Default,Tomo,0000,0000,0000,,They won, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.10,0:06:15.64,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.06,0:06:18.35,Default,Tomo,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to go cheer for the women's volleyball team next.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.35,0:06:19.73,Default,Tomo,0000,0000,0000,,Want to walk over together?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.44,0:06:22.57,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You don't mind?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.57,0:06:24.36,Default,Tomo,0000,0000,0000,,Why would we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.36,0:06:27.15,Default,Tomo,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you want to go cheer for Ayane-chan and Chizu-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.15,0:06:28.49,Default,Tomo,0000,0000,0000,,Ekko's also in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.07,0:06:30.78,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.28,0:06:35.62,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Did I say something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.08,0:06:38.33,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,N-No, that's not it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.42,0:06:40.58,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really touched...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.79,0:06:44.42,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for inviting me. That brightened my day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.30,0:06:49.97,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Just a few days ago, being alone was normal for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.09,0:06:53.97,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone around me is so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.56,0:07:00.19,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,If even one person was missing,\N things wouldn't have turned out this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.06,0:07:04.44,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,If I hadn't met Kazehaya-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.23,0:07:10.11,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I would have never known how nice these people were.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.91,0:07:15.20,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,He changed... my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.20,0:07:17.33,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Admiration...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.33,0:07:18.54,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Respect...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.12,0:07:21.00,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Romantic feelings...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.00,0:07:24.17,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I don't understand my own feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.84,0:07:26.05,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I want to understand them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.05,0:07:27.13,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.17,0:07:30.51,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Wouldn't that put him on the same level as Kazehaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.05,0:07:38.43,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe I'll understand if I start talking to Sanada-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.22,0:07:41.52,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if I'll find my answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.65,0:07:50.40,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,All right, let's go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.40,0:07:51.74,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder who's playing next.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.74,0:07:54.24,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Women's volleyball and men's soccer, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.53,0:07:55.28,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Ryu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.49,0:07:57.58,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.58,0:07:58.70,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,About earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.70,0:07:59.66,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.67,0:08:06.84,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have feelings for Kuronuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.42,0:08:09.09,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right. Sakako.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.09,0:08:09.76,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.76,0:08:12.05,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Sawako, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.80,0:08:14.30,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Just call her "Kuronuma", okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.59,0:08:15.68,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Kuranuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.68,0:08:18.56,Note,,0000,0000,0000,,Note: "Kuro" is Japanese for "black"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.68,0:08:16.68,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,"Kuro"!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.68,0:08:18.56,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, "black".
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.77,0:08:29.40,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,I like Kuroyama as a friend, but it's not what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.95,0:08:34.32,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,It's "Kuronuma", geez!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.36,0:08:36.87,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that what I just said?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.32,0:08:38.70,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,No, you said "yama"!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.70,0:08:39.49,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.91,0:08:43.00,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,What, that thing from earlier bugging you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.00,0:08:44.54,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Nah, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.54,0:08:47.54,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,I only got that because I was nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.92,0:08:50.17,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.21,0:08:52.72,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.39,0:09:00.39,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I still I wish I was the one who saved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.93,0:09:03.35,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.35,0:09:06.56,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Both women's soccer and men's\N softball made it out of the first round.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.52,0:09:09.19,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,They owe me yakiniku!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.19,0:09:10.32,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.07,0:09:15.07,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to check the schedule for the sports festival committee.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.07,0:09:15.78,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.82,0:09:18.57,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,What year and class are you in?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.57,0:09:19.62,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,And what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.24,0:09:21.49,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.49,0:09:24.58,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine! I can check it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.58,0:09:25.54,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.54,0:09:26.50,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Just tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.50,0:09:28.46,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll look it up for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.50,0:09:34.21,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to make you do extra work...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.76,0:09:37.63,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell is up with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.34,0:09:39.22,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.22,0:09:40.97,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.39,0:09:43.27,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya is...
