Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.98,0:09:45.98,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.35,0:09:48.77,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,He'll be putting away the equipment after lunch...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.77,0:09:50.52,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,He needs to carry them to the equipment room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.98,0:09:53.03,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Get out of here once you're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.32,0:09:54.40,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.61,0:09:57.36,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.53,0:09:59.91,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to bother you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.91,0:10:01.33,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,N-No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:07.16,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,What was with that extra smile...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.88,0:10:20.01,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I've...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.76,0:10:23.51,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I've always been watching him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.81,0:10:34.57,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see... What did Chizu want again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.74,0:10:43.45,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, if it isn't Kurumi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.45,0:10:47.79,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,You're Yano Ayane-chan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.79,0:10:50.54,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Sawako-chan and Chizu-chan's friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.54,0:10:53.67,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You went to the same middle school as Chizu, righ-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.88,0:11:00.47,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, what kind of toner do you use?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.47,0:11:02.59,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really wear makeup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.22,0:11:06.97,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,I'm doing a facial tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.93,0:11:09.39,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,The expensive ones my sister bought!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.73,0:11:13.44,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,I'm surprised you know my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.44,0:11:16.65,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, well I guess it shouldn't be a surprise, after all those rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.65,0:11:18.24,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.90,0:11:20.65,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn't worry about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.65,0:11:22.61,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Those who believe them are wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.49,0:11:24.53,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.41,0:11:27.74,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,The ones who believe them are idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.08,0:11:31.42,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you've also heard the rumors, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:33.00,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Did you ever spread them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.00,0:11:34.04,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.04,0:11:38.92,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't believe them in the first place.\N I just heard some girls talking about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.26,0:11:40.84,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.84,0:11:43.84,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,I can never imagine you spreading rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.89,0:11:47.43,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,You think too much of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.98,0:11:56.06,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Only someone who likes Kazehaya would start a rumor like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.61,0:12:00.11,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,She probably thought Sawako was in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.11,0:12:04.16,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,And it's hard for the person to do\N anything about it if Chizu and I are with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.70,0:12:07.95,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Putting my rumors aside...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.95,0:12:12.25,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,...most of Chizu's rumors were real, but heavily exaggerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.58,0:12:18.46,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,So I'm thinking that the girl who started the rumors must\N have gone to the same middle school as Chizu and Kazehaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.88,0:12:22.76,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what she'd do if Kazehaya were to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.80,0:12:27.05,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.51,0:12:31.52,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,But you can't really accuse anyone without proof, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.73,0:12:35.77,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.77,0:12:41.15,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,This conversation kind of dragged on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.53,0:12:43.65,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.65,0:12:46.91,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,I'd better get going, since my match starts soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.91,0:12:49.20,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Well, good luck to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:51.33,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.29,0:12:53.25,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.33,0:12:56.75,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.38,0:13:00.30,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Sawako's pretty tough, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.30,0:13:02.71,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,She really fights head on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.56,0:13:13.98,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya has another match coming up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.98,0:13:15.52,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,He was assigned two, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.52,0:13:17.52,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,And he also has his duties as a committee member...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.52,0:13:20.02,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,What are your plans now, Ryu?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.36,0:13:21.98,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to go grab lunch and take a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.28,0:13:24.90,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,It's not even lunchtime yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.90,0:13:26.61,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Then a siesta?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.74,0:13:28.45,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Trash?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.45,0:13:36.29,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1.5\fnComplete in Him\b1\fs80\fscy120\frz-8\c&H171414&\t(\fscx95\fscy115)\move(861,636,866.1,631)}I want to thank you. Please come to\N the sports equipment room at noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.45,0:13:36.29,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1.5\fnComplete in Him\b1\fs80\fscy120\frz-3\c&H171414&\t(\fscx95\fscy115)\move(815,1000,823,972)}Kuronuma   Sawako
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.46,0:13:38.79,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,But I wanted to take a nap...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.13,0:13:41.96,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,What's up, Ryu?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.96,0:13:43.51,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.51,0:13:45.34,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,I'll just take a nap outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.34,0:13:46.68,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Outside? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.68,0:13:49.43,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Somewhere near the equipment room, I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.43,0:13:51.51,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I-If I may ask... Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.68,0:13:56.02,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,"Tough"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.44,0:13:59.90,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I just miscalculated a bit, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.78,0:14:06.15,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Good work! Here are towels for you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.61,0:14:07.95,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, Sadako!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.95,0:14:10.24,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Did you see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.24,0:14:12.16,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, you looked so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.16,0:14:13.24,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Being so red and all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.24,0:14:15.33,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Gosh, you're making me blush.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.33,0:14:17.46,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,So you just wanted to be red?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.46,0:14:19.29,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,So, what now? Want to go grab lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.29,0:14:20.38,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.38,0:14:21.84,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,I'm hungry now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.84,0:14:22.96,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.63,0:14:26.21,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I have something to do, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.21,0:14:27.38,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Something to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.38,0:14:33.64,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Sanada-kun saved me from getting hit\N by a ball earlier, so I want to go thank him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.64,0:14:35.31,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, he really did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.31,0:14:37.48,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,So even Ryu does something nice every now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.48,0:14:38.64,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.73,0:14:42.15,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,There's also something I want to confirm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.32,0:14:49.11,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really understand myself either,\N and I don't know where to begin, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.11,0:14:50.32,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.37,0:14:55.37,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Do you mind hearing me out when I finally understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.58,0:14:58.91,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Not too sure I understand what you mean, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.91,0:15:00.25,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Of course we'll be there for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.58,0:15:03.71,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.54,0:15:05.92,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'd better get going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.30,0:15:08.30,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Sawako.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.30,0:15:09.93,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be fooled, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.47,0:15:14.43,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You just need to trust what your heart says.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.01,0:15:15.97,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.77,0:15:20.27,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, what was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.27,0:15:24.90,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I guess it just means she has a lot to think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.90,0:15:25.86,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,A lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.07,0:15:30.36,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,And there are also things {\i1}we{\i0\fscx30} {\r} need to take care of, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.78,0:15:33.53,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You look like a villain, Yano-chin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.41,0:15:35.53,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Sawako-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.45,0:15:39.62,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.62,0:15:41.12,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Have you met up with Sanada yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.12,0:15:42.71,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I saw him earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.88,0:15:45.92,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,What's with that face?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.92,0:15:48.34,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You're still willing to talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.34,0:15:54.09,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I was thinking I may have said something earlier to make you angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.01,0:15:56.56,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Geez, you're so annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.85,0:15:57.93,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,That was amazing, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.93,0:15:58.64,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.18,0:16:02.48,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sanada-kun was headed for the sports equipment room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.60,0:16:05.61,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for telling me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.49,0:16:15.07,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Sh-She's not really tough... I'd say she's difficult...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.05,0:16:31.26,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sanada-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.55,0:16:36.68,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, so you're finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.68,0:16:38.22,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.60,0:16:39.47,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Kuro-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.94,0:16:47.69,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Kuronuma Sawako.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.69,0:16:49.02,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.02,0:16:50.40,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, I'm amazed!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.40,0:16:52.74,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Nah, it was written here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.07,0:16:53.95,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.49,0:16:59.49,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, I wonder how my thoughts made it on that piece of paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.37,0:17:06.46,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Umm... thank you for saving my life earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.33,0:17:10.09,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks to you, I still have my life ahead of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.09,0:17:14.55,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,No, I don't think there was that much power behind that ball...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.55,0:17:15.80,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Please take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.84,0:17:17.76,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,I can have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.27,0:17:35.78,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1800,0)\blur1\fnBudhand\fs80\fsp7\c&H283F3E&\t(\fscx93\fscy93)\move(900,280,900,300)}So peaceful...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.11,0:17:37.95,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.70,0:17:41.87,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,W-Well, the thing is, I wanted to have a chat with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.24,0:17:43.29,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.58,0:17:44.58,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,About what...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.75,0:17:49.71,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Do you happen to know what romantic feelings are like?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.59,0:17:55.13,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Romantic feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.13,0:17:59.09,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,In other words, you "like" them, but not really as friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.09,0:18:00.51,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,They're more special-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.76,0:18:01.68,Default-alt,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,No, you don't need to explain it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.14,0:18:06.18,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.56,0:18:10.31,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,I... only love Chizuru.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.31,0:18:12.32,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Keep it between us, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.20,0:18:18.20,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.20,0:18:20.32,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I think you two would make a great couple!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.82,0:18:22.08,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for the praise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.38,0:18:34.55,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.55,0:18:35.67,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumizawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.46,0:18:39.09,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,That looks heavy. Want me to carry a few?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.43,0:18:40.39,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.55,0:18:43.60,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.22,0:18:46.89,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,No, I was just thinking what Kuronuma would say...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.89,0:18:50.85,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,"This is my job, after all."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.45,0:19:00.70,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.41,0:19:04.37,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Is it really true you rejected\N Sawako-chan before summer vacation started?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.37,0:19:05.16,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.16,0:19:08.12,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,People are still talking about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.58,0:19:09.75,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,No, I didn't reject her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.96,0:19:12.04,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.63,0:19:17.46,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,And besides, it's not like she\N confessed her feelings to me or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.01,0:19:22.80,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,She doesn't like me that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.10,0:19:26.68,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.68,0:19:29.56,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,When I asked her if she wanted to date you, her reply was, "No way."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.48,0:19:35.98,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,And she wasn't even watching you earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.98,0:19:37.73,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.69,0:19:40.15,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,During the softball game.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.65,0:19:43.66,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Her eyes were on Sanada, and Sanada only.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.28,0:19:49.12,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I guess you can't blame her for\N falling for him, after Sanada saved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.83,0:19:57.96,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,If she really does like him, let's encourage them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.34,0:20:00.05,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,For her sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.67,0:20:03.30,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,When did you start liking Yoshida-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.89,0:20:05.55,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.55,0:20:07.18,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,What made you start liking her?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.18,0:20:08.56,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,I'm trying to think...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.35,0:20:11.89,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,What made you realize she was special?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.94,0:20:19.90,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.90,0:20:22.11,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Are those questions that need to be answered logically?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.33,0:20:30.58,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,When I became aware of it,\N I realized she'd always been special to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.83,0:20:33.71,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,I can't even compare her to anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.83,0:20:38.55,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,S-So if you can't compare someone\N with others, does that make them special?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.09,0:20:41.26,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.34,0:20:45.59,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Would you rather have it be that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.26,0:20:48.85,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,If... that was true...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.82,0:21:05.24,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,See? I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.24,0:21:06.99,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Let's cheer them on in the shadows, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.00,0:21:25.97,Kimi_no_Todoke_ED1-RO,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}{\kf54}So{\kf43}no {\kf44}so{\kf30}ra {\kf21}i{\kf17}p{\kf26}pa{\kf31}i {\kf22}no {\kf41}ka{\kf21}mi{\kf38}hi{\kf46}ko{\kf41}u{\kf45}ki{\kf37} {\kf49}gu{\kf49}ra{\kf26}i {\kf41}ni {\kf62}na{\kf21}t{\kf252}te{\kf40}
